{"id":"d828bbffc0f86990","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-pairwise-independent-family.md","title":"Pairwise Independence","display":"df-pairwise-independent-family — Pairwise Independence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-pairwise-independent-family","aliases":["28-df-pairwise-independent-family","Pairwise Independent Hash Family"],"display":"df-pairwise-independent-family — Pairwise Independence","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"Definition 8.14; printed p.152; PDF p.178","source_printed_pages":"152","source_pdf_pages":"178","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-pairwise-independent-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-pairwise-independent-family</span><span>Pairwise Independent Hash Family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pairwise-independent-family — Pairwise Independence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 8.14; printed p.152; PDF p.178"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"152"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"178"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,R\">\\(D,R\\)</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq R^D\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq R^D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{\\mathcal H}\">\\(U_{\\mathcal H}\\)</span> 为有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\">\\(\\mathcal H\\)</span> 上均匀分布。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;D,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;D,R)\\)</span> 是两两独立且各单点均匀的函数族谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;D,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left[\\forall x\\in D\\;\\forall a\\in R\\;\\Pr_{h\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}}[h(x)=a]=|R|^{-1}\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\forall a,b\\in R\\;\\left(x\\ne y\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{h\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}}[h(x)=a\\land h(y)=b]=|R|^{-2}\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;D,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left[\\forall x\\in D\\;\\forall a\\in R\\;\\Pr_{h\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}}[h(x)=a]=|R|^{-1}\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\forall a,b\\in R\\;\\left(x\\ne y\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{h\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}}[h(x)=a\\land h(y)=b]=|R|^{-2}\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定义 8.14 的二进制定义域含至少两个元素时，单点均匀由二点条件推出。本节点允许任意有限非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>，显式加上边缘均匀，修复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|D|=1\">\\(|D|=1\\)</span> 时二点条件空真的退化；不改变原书在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span> 时的含义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D,R","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq R^D","display":false},{"tex":"U_{\\mathcal H}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;D,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;D,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left[\\forall x\\in D\\;\\forall a\\in R\\;\\Pr_{h\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}}[h(x)=a]=|R|^{-1}\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\forall a,b\\in R\\;\\left(x\\ne y\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{h\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}}[h(x)=a\\land h(y)=b]=|R|^{-2}\\right)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"|D|=1","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false}],"bytes":1369,"backlinks":[{"id":"845d0e1921c301a4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这是 §8.2.2 散列工具的碰撞概率接口补充，原书定义 8.14 明确给出的是更强的两两独立条件。对 $a\\in R$ 求和可从 [[28-df-pairwise-independent-family]] 推出本条件；本条件不单独保证单点均匀。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"随机散列：[[28-df-pairwise-independent-family]]、[[28-df-universal-hashing]]。"},{"id":"c301d5689e0f6bf7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$D=\\{0,1\\}^n$，$R=\\{0,1\\}^k$，$\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq R^D$ 有限，满足 [[28-df-pairwise-independent-family]] 的 $\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;D,R)$。\n$S\\subseteq D$，$2^{k-2}\\le|S|\\le2^{k-1}$；$h$ 在 $\\mathcal H$ 上均匀抽取。$N_h=|\\{x\\in S:h(x)=0^k\\}|$，$\\mu=|S|2^{-k}$。"},{"id":"97a794aef4eec69f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq(\\{0,1\\}^m)^{\\{0,1\\}^n}$ 且 $\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;\\{0,1\\}^n,\\{0,1\\}^m)$，见 [[28-df-pairwise-independent-family]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}